  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Support to Kyiv School Economics 2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till Kyiv School of Economics 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet bidrar till Kyiv School of Economics arbete med att fr&#xe4;mja Ukrainas integration i Europeiska unionen genom att skapa ett nytt center f&#xf6;r EU-n&#xe4;rmandefr&#xe5;gor. Centret, &#x201d;The Swedish Center for European Future at KSE University&#x201d;, ska bland annat tillhandah&#xe5;lla utbildning och forskning, liksom bredare kunskapsh&#xf6;jande insatser, kopplade till EU-integrationen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project contributes to the Kyiv School of Economics&apos; work of promoting Ukraine&apos;s integration into the European Union by creating a new center for EU rapprochement. The center, called &#x201d;The Swedish Center for European Future at KSE University&#x201d;, will provide education and research, as well as broader knowledge-raising efforts, linked to EU integration.</narrative>
  </description>
